          "name": "Spiny Defense",
          "type": "ex",
          "description": "As a move action, a dark hedgehog can roll itself up into a spiny ball. While rolled up, it gains a +2 enhancement bonus to its existing natural armor, and any creature attempting to grapple the dark hedgehog takes 1d6 damage on making a grapple check. While rolled up, a dark hedgehog cannot take an action other than leaving this state or casting a spell. The dark hedgehog can leave this state as a move action.",
